Redface 2 v0.60.0 — beta.
- Smooth text selection in the editor, even beyond the screen; double-tap selects the word, triple-tap the line.
- The caret stays visible when the keyboard opens.
- Tap outside text to clear selection in topics and private messages.
- Android 10: the keyboard no longer hides the editor.
- A banner helps when the image picker returns nothing.
